Hidefumi Yabu <yabu76@gmail.com>:

 * Add Lua API tio.twrite() that supports output-mapping, output-delay, and input-mode
 * Add option output-line-delay-char to specify the line-delay trigger character
 * Add --script function to the ctrl-t r key command ("Run script")
 * Add support for multiple patterns to the Lua API tio.expects()
 * Add cleanup-read to tio.expect[s] to speed up pattern matching
 * Add tio.C constants table to the Lua API
 * Add tio.C.NOWAIT and tio.C.WAIT_FOREVER timeout constants to tio.read and tio.expect[s]
 * Add history and line-editing support with a simple prompt to ctrl-t command string input
 * Add a simple prompt to line-input-mode (history and line-editing already supported)
 * Make the Lua interpreter keep its state while tio is running
 * Add socket examples for bidirectional command helpers and pexpect
 * Add Lua REPL mode that supporting multi-line statements and line editing
 * Remove the taint flag setting from clear_line() and print_line()
 * Change serial device writes to write_poll (poll() + write()) to prevent non-blocking write errors
 * Fix execute_shell_command to use tty_write so output-delay and output-mapping work
 * Fix non-interactive mode to use tty_write so output-delay and output-mapping work
 * Fix ctrl-t c to display yes/no for functions instead of true/false settings
 * Add options --raw and --raw-interactive and ctrl-t j/J subcommands for raw communication
 * Add bidirectional redirection to shell command execution (ctrl-t R and --exec option)
 * Add option --script-init-file to load and execute a file when tio starts
 * Add user key-script mapping (--keymap, ctrl-t k)
 * Add Lua functions that handle input from a thread that uses standard input.
    tio.inkey()
    tio.input()
    tio.inputline()
 * Add Lua API functions equivalent to some key commands
    tio.receive()
    tio.send_break()
    tio.line_get()
    tio.set_local_echo()
    tio.set_log()
    tio.flush_data_io_buffer()
    tio.set_input_mode()
    tio.set_output_mode()
    tio.set_raw_mode()
    tio.set_raw_mode_interactive()
    tio.set_timestamp_mode()
    tio.exec_shell_command()
    tio.get_state()
    tio.get_version()
    tio.set_keymap()
    tio.subcmd_println(), tio.subcmd_warning_println(), tio.subcmd_error_println()
    tio.subcmd_puts(), tio.subcmd_warning_puts(), tio.subcmd_error_println()
 * Add feature to save/load the line-input-history to/from files on exit/startup.
   To suppress this feature, add option --no-line-history-save.
 * Add Luajit support.
 * Add Lua API tio.input_thread_pause(), input_thread_resume().
 * Add Lua API tio.set_stdin_mode(), set_stdout_mode().
 * Fix redundant tty configuration when stdin and stdout are connected to the same tty.
 * Add Lua API tio.set_sleep_echo()
 * Add Lua API tio.set_hook()
 * Add Lua API tio.start_timer(), tio.stop_timer() for timeout hooking.
 * Add inherit option to log-timestamp-format.
 * Add option --config-file/-C that use specified config file.

